%N A126398 Number of base 11 n-digit numbers with adjacent digits differing by two or less.
%C A126398 [Empirical] a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+5^(n-1) for base>=2n-1; a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+5^(n-1)-2 when base=2n-2.
%H A126398 Rafał Wiktorowicz, <a href="/A126371/a126371_1.pdf">Proofs of the conjectured recurrences and generating functions for the adjacent-digits family</a>, 2026.
%H A126398 <a href="/index/Rec#order_06">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (7,-9,-11,11,2,-1).
%F A126398 G.f.: (1+4*x-19*x^2-8*x^3+19*x^4+x^5-2*x^6) / (1-7*x+9*x^2+11*x^3-11*x^4-2*x^5+x^6). - _Colin Barker_, Jul 17 2017
